# Code owners for Katharsis.
#
# When a pull request modifies a matched path, GitHub requests a review
# from the listed owners. Later patterns take precedence over earlier ones.
# Reference: https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositories-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners

# Everything the plugin executes on an installer's machine, and the
# manifests that decide what Claude Code installs.
/.github/                  @holdenhewett @Open-Scribbler
/.claude-plugin/           @holdenhewett @Open-Scribbler
/scripts/                  @holdenhewett @Open-Scribbler
/skills/                   @holdenhewett @Open-Scribbler

/hooks/                    @holdenhewett @Open-Scribbler
/bin/                      @holdenhewett @Open-Scribbler

# What the model reads every turn.
/output-styles/            @holdenhewett @Open-Scribbler
/styles/                   @holdenhewett @Open-Scribbler

/SECURITY.md               @holdenhewett @Open-Scribbler
